-- paths.talk: `set` through a property's value (ADR 0135, chapter 8).
-- Part of the set-paths case.

on setting button, k, xs
  set the label of button to "OK"
  set the (k) of the panel of button to 5
  set the isLocked of the door of me to true
  set item 2 of the tags of it to "new"
  set the label of item 2 of xs to "x"
  set the x of the (k) of the pos of me to 1
end setting
